releaseNotes:
Release 2.0.0

        The library now supports net8.0+

        All drawing routines moved to use SkiaSharp

        Release 1.0.1

        Currently the library supports generation of the following types of barcodes and QR codes:
        - EAN8;
        - EAN13;
        - GS1-128A;
        - GS1-128B;
        - GS1-128C;
        - UPC_A;
        - QR codes.
